# GraphQL API 开发

GraphQL 是一种用于 API 的查询语言，提供了比 REST 更灵活、更高效的数据获取方式。本教程将带你深入学习 GraphQL API 开发的核心概念和实践技巧。

## 什么是 GraphQL？

GraphQL 是一种数据查询语言和运行时环境，由 Facebook 于 2012 年创建，2015 年开源。

### 核心特性

- **按需查询**: 客户端精确指定需要的数据
- **单一端点**: 所有请求通过一个 URL
- **强类型 Schema**: 类型系统确保 API 可预测
- **实时订阅**: 支持实时数据推送
- **自文档化**: Schema 即文档

### GraphQL vs REST

| 特性 | REST | GraphQL |
|------|------|---------|
| 端点 | 多个 | 单一 |
| 数据获取 | 可能过度/不足获取 | 精确获取 |
| 版本控制 | 需要版本管理 | Schema 演进 |
| 类型系统 | 无/弱类型 | 强类型 |
| 缓存 | HTTP 缓存友好 | 需要额外处理 |

## Schema 设计

### 基本类型定义

```graphql
# schema.graphql

scalar Date

enum UserRole {
  ADMIN
  USER
  GUEST
}

type User {
  id: ID!
  username: String!
  email: String!
  role: UserRole!
  createdAt: Date!
  posts: [Post!]!
  friends: [User!]!
}

type Post {
  id: ID!
  title: String!
  content: String!
  author: User!
  comments: [Comment!]!
  createdAt: Date!
}

type Comment {
  id: ID!
  content: String!
  author: User!
  post: Post!
  createdAt: Date!
}
```

### Query 和 Mutation

```graphql
type Query {
  # 用户查询
  me: User
  user(id: ID!): User
  users(limit: Int, offset: Int): [User!]!

  # 帖子查询
  post(id: ID!): Post
  posts(userId: ID, limit: Int): [Post!]!

  # 搜索
  search(query: String!, type: String!): SearchResult!
}

type Mutation {
  # 用户操作
  login(email: String!, password: String!): AuthPayload!
  register(username: String!, email: String!, password: String!): User!
  updateProfile(input: UpdateUserInput!): User!

  # 帖子操作
  createPost(input: CreatePostInput!): Post!
  updatePost(id: ID!, input: UpdatePostInput!): Post!
  deletePost(id: ID!): Boolean!

  # 评论操作
  addComment(postId: ID!, content: String!): Comment!
}

type Subscription {
  # 实时订阅
  newPosts: Post!
  newComments(postId: ID!): Comment!
  userOnline(userId: ID!): Boolean!
}
```

### Input 类型

```graphql
input CreatePostInput {
  title: String!
  content: String!
  tags: [String!]
}

input UpdatePostInput {
  title: String
  content: String
  tags: [String!]
}

input UpdateUserInput {
  username: String
  email: String
  avatar: String
}

# 分页输入
input PaginationInput {
  first: Int
  after: String
  last: Int
  before: String
}
```

## Resolver 实现

### 基础 Resolver

```javascript
// resolvers.js
const { User, Post, Comment } = require('./models');

const resolvers = {
  Query: {
    me: (parent, args, { user }) => {
      if (!user) throw new Error('Not authenticated');
      return User.findById(user.id);
    },

    user: (parent, { id }) => {
      return User.findById(id);
    },

    users: (parent, { limit = 10, offset = 0 }) => {
      return User.findAll({ limit, offset });
    },

    post: (parent, { id }) => {
      return Post.findById(id);
    },

    posts: (parent, { userId, limit = 10 }) => {
      const where = userId ? { authorId: userId } : {};
      return Post.findAll({ where, limit });
    }
  },

  Mutation: {
    login: async (parent, { email, password }, { res }) => {
      const user = await User.findOne({ where: { email } });
      if (!user || !(await user.verifyPassword(password))) {
        throw new Error('Invalid credentials');
      }
      const token = user.generateToken();
      return { token, user };
    },

    register: async (parent, { username, email, password }) => {
      const existingUser = await User.findOne({ where: { email } });
      if (existingUser) {
        throw new Error('Email already registered');
      }
      const user = await User.create({ username, email, password });
      return user;
    },

    createPost: async (parent, { input }, { user }) => {
      if (!user) throw new Error('Not authenticated');
      return Post.create({
        ...input,
        authorId: user.id
      });
    },

    deletePost: async (parent, { id }, { user }) => {
      const post = await Post.findById(id);
      if (!post) throw new Error('Post not found');
      if (post.authorId !== user.id && user.role !== 'ADMIN') {
        throw new Error('Not authorized');
      }
      await post.destroy();
      return true;
    }
  },

  // 字段解析器
  User: {
    posts: (user, args) => {
      return Post.findAll({ where: { authorId: user.id } });
    },
    friends: (user, args) => {
      return user.getFriends();
    }
  },

  Post: {
    author: (post) => post.getAuthor(),
    comments: (post) => post.getComments()
  },

  Comment: {
    author: (comment) => comment.getAuthor(),
    post: (comment) => comment.getPost()
  }
};

module.exports = resolvers;
```

### 服务器设置

```javascript
// server.js
const { ApolloServer } = require('@apollo/server');
const { expressMiddleware } = require('@apollo/server/express4');
const { makeExecutableSchema } = require('@graphql-tools/schema');
const express = require('express');
const cors = require('cors');
const jwt = require('jsonwebtoken');

const typeDefs = require('./schema');
const resolvers = require('./resolvers');

const schema = makeExecutableSchema({ typeDefs, resolvers });

const server = new ApolloServer({
  schema,
  context: async ({ req, res }) => {
    // 认证中间件
    const token = req.headers.authorization?.replace('Bearer ', '');
    let user = null;

    if (token) {
      try {
        user = jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET);
      } catch (e) {
        // Token 无效
      }
    }

    return { user, res };
  },

  // 格式化错误
  formatError: (err) => {
    if (err.extensions.code === 'UNAUTHENTICATED') {
      return new Error('You must be logged in');
    }
    return err;
  },

  // 启用 Playground（开发环境）
  introspection: process.env.NODE_ENV !== 'production'
});

const app = express();
app.use(cors());
app.use(express.json());

await server.start();
app.use('/graphql', expressMiddleware(server));

app.listen(4000, () => {
  console.log('GraphQL server ready at http://localhost:4000/graphql');
});
```

## DataLoader 批量加载

### N+1 问题

```graphql
# 这个查询会导致 N+1 问题
query {
  users {
    id
    username
    posts {
      id
      title
    }
  }
}
```

### DataLoader 实现

```javascript
const DataLoader = require('dataloader');

// 创建 User loader
const userLoader = new DataLoader(async (userIds) => {
  const users = await User.findAll({
    where: { id: userIds }
  });

  // 按 ID 返回用户
  return userIds.map(id => 
    users.find(user => user.id === id) || null
  );
});

// 创建 Post loader
const postLoader = new DataLoader(async (postIds) => {
  const posts = await Post.findAll({
    where: { id: postIds }
  });

  return postIds.map(id =>
    posts.find(post => post.id === id) || null
  );
});

// 批量加载用户的帖子
const userPostsLoader = new DataLoader(async (userIds) => {
  const posts = await Post.findAll({
    where: { authorId: userIds }
  });

  return userIds.map(id =>
    posts.filter(post => post.authorId === id)
  );
});

// 在 resolver 中使用
const resolvers = {
  Post: {
    author: (post, args, { userLoader }) => {
      return userLoader.load(post.authorId);
    }
  },

  User: {
    posts: (user, args, { userPostsLoader }) => {
      return userPostsLoader.load(user.id);
    }
  }
};

// 将 loaders 添加到 context
const server = new ApolloServer({
  schema,
  context: ({ req }) => ({
    userLoader,
    postLoader,
    userPostsLoader,
    user: getUser(req)
  })
});
```

## 分页和连接

### Relay 风格分页

```graphql
type PageInfo {
  hasNextPage: Boolean!
  hasPreviousPage: Boolean!
  startCursor: String
  endCursor: String
}

type PostEdge {
  node: Post!
  cursor: String!
}

type PostConnection {
  edges: [PostEdge!]!
  pageInfo: PageInfo!
  totalCount: Int!
}

type Query {
  posts(first: Int, after: String, last: Int, before: String): PostConnection!
}
```

### 分页 Resolver

```javascript
const resolvers = {
  Query: {
    posts: async (parent, { first, after, last, before }) => {
      const limit = first || last || 10;
      const cursor = after || before;

      // 解码 cursor
      let offset = 0;
      if (cursor) {
        offset = Buffer.from(cursor, 'base64').readInt32BE(0);
      }

      const posts = await Post.findAll({
        limit: limit + 1,
        offset: after ? offset + 1 : 0,
        order: [['createdAt', 'DESC']]
      });

      const hasNextPage = posts.length > limit;
      const hasPreviousPage = offset > 0;

      if (hasNextPage) posts.pop();

      const edges = posts.map((post, index) => ({
        node: post,
        cursor: Buffer.from(`${offset + index}`).toString('base64')
      }));

      return {
        edges,
        pageInfo: {
          hasNextPage,
          hasPreviousPage,
          startCursor: edges[0]?.cursor,
          endCursor: edges[edges.length - 1]?.cursor
        },
        totalCount: await Post.count()
      };
    }
  }
};
```

